WEBVTT

00:01.770 --> 00:05.280
Dear Mother, I have been released from prison.

00:05.940 --> 00:07.650
But Francis is still...

00:09.010 --> 00:11.330
I have to prove that Francis isn't the Black Rose.

00:11.940 --> 00:16.440
I will definitely find out where Rosso and Bianco are so that I can help him.

00:26.770 --> 00:27.930
NAAJA

00:26.770 --> 00:27.930
Nadja

00:27.960 --> 00:30.430
kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:27.980 --> 00:30.430
With your eyes

00:30.430 --> 00:31.590
NAAJA

00:30.480 --> 00:31.590
Nadja

00:31.610 --> 00:33.860
nani ga mieru

00:31.610 --> 00:33.860
What do you see?

00:34.080 --> 00:36.970
haruka tooku hikaru

00:34.080 --> 00:36.970
Shining in the far distance,

00:37.120 --> 00:39.260
mirai no tobira

00:37.120 --> 00:39.260
The door to the future,

00:40.400 --> 00:43.810
sagashiteiru

00:40.400 --> 00:43.810
That's what I'm searching for

00:43.810 --> 00:51.020
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.730 --> 00:55.140
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:55.240 --> 00:58.500
arasoimo kitto nakunaru

00:55.240 --> 00:58.500
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:58.570 --> 01:01.950
kon nani mo tanoshiku naru

00:58.600 --> 01:01.950
It could be so much more fun

01:01.980 --> 01:05.430
sekai wa hiruikedo hitotsune

01:01.980 --> 01:05.430
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:05.800 --> 01:09.160
tabi no owari wa mienai

01:05.800 --> 01:09.160
I can't see the end of the journey

01:09.190 --> 01:12.350
kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:09.190 --> 01:12.350
God is the only one who can possibly know

01:12.520 --> 01:16.170
itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:12.520 --> 01:16.170
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:16.170 --> 01:18.320
te wo furinagara

01:16.170 --> 01:18.320
I will go waving

01:18.470 --> 01:25.210
toki ni wa BURUU ni naru himo aru kedo

01:18.470 --> 01:25.210
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:25.210 --> 01:27.950
ushiro mukanai

01:25.210 --> 01:27.950
But I won't look back

01:28.220 --> 01:33.260
yume ga kanau hima de

01:28.220 --> 01:33.260
Until the day my dream comes true

01:33.430 --> 01:36.810
NAAJA kimi no hoho emi wa

01:33.430 --> 01:36.810
Nadja, your smile

01:36.890 --> 01:40.090
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:36.890 --> 01:40.090
Nadja, you give me courage

01:40.390 --> 01:43.350
aoi sora no shita de

01:40.390 --> 01:43.350
Under the blue sky

01:43.330 --> 01:46.140
ashita no yukue

01:43.330 --> 01:46.140
I will find the place

01:46.660 --> 01:50.290
mitsu kerukara

01:46.660 --> 01:50.290
Where my future lies

02:16.270 --> 02:17.140
I don't need this.

02:19.410 --> 02:21.330
The Black Rose has been arrested.

02:21.950 --> 02:24.440
The one hope that common people had...

02:24.910 --> 02:26.990
There aren't any more dreams or hopes.

02:29.010 --> 02:30.120
There is hope.

02:31.650 --> 02:36.120
It seems that an advance notice from the Black Rose has reached some villain called Joseph.

02:37.180 --> 02:39.650
The real Black Rose hasn't been caught.

02:41.060 --> 02:42.220
Really?

02:43.480 --> 02:45.480
Just wait, Rosso and Bianco!

02:45.720 --> 02:47.530
I will definitely find you!

02:50.980 --> 02:53.990
Harvey, I'll search over here and leave this area to you.

02:54.460 --> 02:55.030
Sure.

02:55.720 --> 02:56.690
Alright!

02:59.230 --> 03:03.970
Even if we find Rosso and Bianco, there's no guarantee that they will tell the truth.

03:04.710 --> 03:06.390
It's over if they don't.

03:07.970 --> 03:11.130
That can't be! The Black Rose was captured by the police.

03:11.670 --> 03:14.580
Joseph has gathered his bodyguards.

03:14.950 --> 03:17.690
That means the real Black Rose hasn't been caught.

03:17.920 --> 03:18.730
Then that means...

03:18.830 --> 03:19.500
Yeah...

03:19.790 --> 03:23.080
It's true that he has received an advanced notice from the Black Rose.

03:23.180 --> 03:25.200
That story...is it really true?

03:25.840 --> 03:26.980
Y-yeah...

03:27.320 --> 03:28.460
That's the rumor.

03:29.770 --> 03:30.930
The Black Rose...

03:31.300 --> 03:33.540
Keith Harcourt is in the city.

03:39.840 --> 03:44.280
Reversal! The End of the Black Rose

03:52.260 --> 03:54.110
You certainly do eat a lot.

03:54.360 --> 03:56.180
I have to eat properly to add stamina.

03:56.530 --> 03:58.430
I'll definitely find those two!

03:59.050 --> 04:00.480
Yeah, that's right.

04:01.740 --> 04:04.500
It's better if I don't tell Nadja anything about the Black Rose.

04:05.050 --> 04:07.090
If I tell her, she'll surely do something reckless.

04:08.180 --> 04:10.400
The Black Rose will move in on Vienna tonight.

04:11.070 --> 04:15.170
While his little brother Francis is still in prison, just what does he intend to do?

04:15.860 --> 04:16.800
Harvey!

04:17.120 --> 04:18.500
You have to eat properly!

04:18.700 --> 04:20.300
A...ha ha, right...

04:22.670 --> 04:23.910
Francis Harcourt...?

04:24.500 --> 04:25.490
No, that's not right...

04:25.780 --> 04:26.420
That's...

04:32.520 --> 04:36.180
Nadja, I've just remembered something. I'll be going ahead.

04:36.790 --> 04:38.200
I'll leave it to you to settle the bill.

04:38.500 --> 04:39.830
Oh! Thanks for the meal.

04:39.900 --> 04:40.670
Be careful.

04:40.740 --> 04:41.260
I will.

05:04.220 --> 05:05.430
Keith Harcourt...

05:05.750 --> 05:06.490
You...

05:10.570 --> 05:13.180
You are the Black Rose, aren't you.

05:13.650 --> 05:14.340
And you are?

05:14.940 --> 05:17.280
I'm a reporter from Montmartre Journal.

05:17.770 --> 05:19.180
Um...my card...

05:19.430 --> 05:20.890
Harvey Livingston, right?

05:22.370 --> 05:23.260
You knew?

05:24.960 --> 05:28.740
Although the Black Rose is heralded as a friend of the common people...

05:29.130 --> 05:34.240
He has been criticized as being a criminal or a hypocrite in the newspapers.

05:34.860 --> 05:43.650
But you only exposed the crimes that the Black Rose imposed upon the nobles he stole from and understood the common people.

05:44.240 --> 05:45.770
That was an ambitious fight, wasn't it?

05:46.410 --> 05:48.360
I'm frequently fired, after all.

05:48.630 --> 05:51.450
I've also been threatened with terrible things.

05:51.740 --> 05:54.610
But whether fighting or being threatened...

05:55.180 --> 05:57.150
This is my conviction.

05:57.550 --> 06:01.770
I thought I was the only one to jump into danger alone.

06:02.610 --> 06:03.990
Looks like there's another one.

06:04.160 --> 06:06.850
Yes, I know the girl called Nadja.

06:07.220 --> 06:10.280
No matter how dangerous the path, she will walk it.

06:13.690 --> 06:14.800
Harvey Livingston.

06:15.270 --> 06:16.850
I have a favor to ask you.

06:23.840 --> 06:25.540
No clues, huh...

06:26.800 --> 06:28.850
Isn't there a better way?

06:31.610 --> 06:32.310
That's right.

06:32.550 --> 06:35.290
Herman's mansion is around here, isn't it?

06:45.810 --> 06:48.650
If I watch from here, I might get some clues.

06:56.550 --> 06:57.090
That was...

06:57.360 --> 06:57.960
Just now...

07:00.870 --> 07:01.680
You two!

07:01.860 --> 07:04.450
How many times have I told you not to get this close!?

07:05.020 --> 07:06.280
Right, right...

07:07.310 --> 07:08.770
Now that you mention it, Bianco...

07:09.070 --> 07:10.890
It's not time for dessert yet, is it?

07:11.560 --> 07:13.040
That's right, brother.

07:13.440 --> 07:16.300
Please buy us some, Mr. Herman.

07:17.360 --> 07:18.740
What did you say?

07:19.340 --> 07:21.260
Oh, it's alright.

07:21.460 --> 07:24.450
We will buy some ourselves...outside.

07:31.330 --> 07:32.350
Damnit.

07:33.060 --> 07:34.540
These two detectives...

07:34.940 --> 07:36.070
Detectives?

07:37.360 --> 07:38.490
Those people are...?

07:38.760 --> 07:39.580
It's nothing.

07:40.270 --> 07:41.880
Do you want to stay on the third floor forever?

07:42.390 --> 07:43.920
Mind your own business.

07:44.620 --> 07:45.500
But, this...

07:45.600 --> 07:46.120
What?

07:46.710 --> 07:49.750
And article about another girl called Nadja.

07:50.140 --> 07:51.480
That one's a fake!

07:51.920 --> 07:52.560
Really?

07:52.960 --> 07:55.500
The girl you brought with you is the real Nadja?

07:56.220 --> 07:58.220
It's as the newspaper says.

07:58.340 --> 08:00.640
Darling, answer me while looking into my eyes!

08:02.290 --> 08:03.030
Shut up!

08:04.090 --> 08:05.700
Women should stay silent.

08:06.460 --> 08:09.130
You should just do as I say.

08:13.180 --> 08:14.900
Darling, please answer me!

08:14.950 --> 08:15.870
You're obstinate!

08:23.640 --> 08:25.590
Mother, I'm home.

08:26.980 --> 08:27.720
Are you alright?

08:28.240 --> 08:28.980
Oscar...

08:31.220 --> 08:32.680
Let's rest for a while.

08:33.200 --> 08:33.590
Come...

08:35.910 --> 08:36.410
Hey!

08:36.800 --> 08:38.280
Have you no greetings for me?

08:39.470 --> 08:42.260
You should be the one greeting me, shouldn't you?

08:43.670 --> 08:44.630
It's custom.

08:49.340 --> 08:51.320
Good afternoon, Herman.

08:53.220 --> 08:54.850
Antonio Fabiani!

08:59.690 --> 09:03.120
The ones I saw in the window were definitely Rosso and Bianco.

09:04.330 --> 09:05.560
I have to see it myself!

09:14.600 --> 09:17.960
The repayment period for the loan has long since passed.

09:18.720 --> 09:20.060
Wait just a little longer.

09:20.350 --> 09:22.570
The Preminger Dukedom will soon be mine.

09:22.770 --> 09:23.730
And then at once I will...

09:23.860 --> 09:24.890
Please trust me.

09:24.970 --> 09:30.050
How am I supposed to trust you when you won't even give in to my request?

09:30.970 --> 09:31.910
Ah...that...

09:32.250 --> 09:34.200
As I said, I will definitely return it...

09:35.310 --> 09:37.210
It's a waste of time talking to you.

09:37.610 --> 09:41.360
Let's speak directly to your father, Duke Preminger.

09:42.000 --> 09:42.790
Please wait!

09:43.290 --> 09:44.100
Only that...

09:44.200 --> 09:45.850
P-please wait...

09:46.870 --> 09:49.190
Then repay it at once.

09:54.520 --> 09:57.260
This is bad. If I don't get some money together soon...

09:57.780 --> 09:59.800
You look unwell, Mr. Herman.

10:00.350 --> 10:02.390
You have no problem laying a hand on your wife...

10:02.620 --> 10:04.300
Yet you seem to be weak from debts.

10:05.090 --> 10:05.880
Oscar!

10:06.150 --> 10:06.790
You...

10:07.480 --> 10:09.680
Why did you bring him here?

10:10.070 --> 10:12.340
I met him by chance at a ball.

10:13.060 --> 10:14.390
It was your recommendation.

10:15.160 --> 10:18.610
To go to a ball to catch some wealthy lady...

10:19.110 --> 10:21.280
I obtained some unexpected information there.

10:22.420 --> 10:26.660
That you borrowed money so that you could search for Aunt Colette's daughter, Nadja.

10:27.210 --> 10:32.140
You probably did it so that you could manage the Preminger finances.

10:32.860 --> 10:33.600
Be silent!

10:33.970 --> 10:36.220
Don't talk to your father like that!

10:36.560 --> 10:37.030
Father?

10:37.700 --> 10:41.250
I have never thought of you as a parent.

10:42.260 --> 10:44.020
I don't care what you are trying to do.

10:44.680 --> 10:47.650
But I won't allow you to hurt my mother anymore.

10:48.710 --> 10:50.730
Y...you won't allow it?

10:51.180 --> 10:52.110
You are...

10:52.110 --> 10:52.810
Mr. Herman.

10:53.500 --> 10:56.580
You made a vast loan with Antonio.

10:57.150 --> 10:59.050
I can settle your enormous loan with Antonio.

11:00.290 --> 11:03.820
I have the plantation my dead father left for me in France.

11:04.360 --> 11:07.890
If I sell it, all of your debts can be payed.

11:08.580 --> 11:09.990
R-really...?

11:10.780 --> 11:12.190
But there are conditions.

11:12.830 --> 11:14.530
You will leave this house.

11:15.220 --> 11:17.960
And swear that you will never appear before my mother again.

11:20.700 --> 11:21.470
Will you swear it?

11:23.300 --> 11:25.320
You impudent child!

11:25.470 --> 11:29.000
I am Colrad's successor, Oscar Colrad.

11:29.540 --> 11:31.640
I will protect this house and mother.

12:19.420 --> 12:20.410
Hurry up!

12:20.830 --> 12:23.870
Ask my father and get some money from the Duke.

12:24.190 --> 12:25.300
The reason doesn't matter.

12:26.140 --> 12:28.260
You deceived father and Colette...

12:28.530 --> 12:29.920
This will be easy for you, won't it?

12:32.480 --> 12:33.690
Hey, are you listening?

12:34.090 --> 12:35.270
Hurry up and get the money!

12:36.310 --> 12:37.400
I refuse.

12:37.910 --> 12:40.680
Why do I have to do such a thing?

12:42.680 --> 12:43.440
You...

12:43.590 --> 12:46.010
You owe it to me that you are here.

12:46.180 --> 12:47.570
What do you think you're doing?

12:49.300 --> 12:50.180
I am...

12:50.750 --> 12:54.410
The granddaughter of Duke Preminger, Nadja Preminger!

12:55.640 --> 12:56.870
You say you're Nadja?

12:56.950 --> 12:58.110
You're a fake.

12:58.210 --> 12:59.070
Listen.

12:59.240 --> 13:03.020
With a single word, I can have you easily thrown out of here.

13:04.850 --> 13:10.430
If you did that, you'd be the one getting in trouble, wouldn't you?

13:11.370 --> 13:14.720
You wouldn't get away with just facing your father's wrath.

13:14.900 --> 13:17.860
Undoubtedly, you would be arrested for trying to get the assets of the Preminger Dukedom.

13:19.020 --> 13:19.660
What?

13:20.670 --> 13:23.780
Please leave, Uncle Herman.

13:27.610 --> 13:29.860
I thank you for your cooperation, Oscar.

13:30.840 --> 13:32.130
Don't misunderstand.

13:32.520 --> 13:33.440
It wasn't for your sake.

13:37.410 --> 13:39.390
I scorn you from the bottom of my heart.

13:39.580 --> 13:40.500
Then, why?

13:41.390 --> 13:43.780
To fight poison with poison.

13:45.430 --> 13:47.110
I don't care about that.

13:47.710 --> 13:49.480
As long as I get my payment.

13:50.250 --> 13:50.960
Antonio!

13:51.930 --> 13:53.240
W-why...

13:53.480 --> 13:54.690
Why is he here?

14:02.400 --> 14:04.200
Where's the other Nadja?

14:05.460 --> 14:06.200
What's this about?

14:07.380 --> 14:09.700
It seems that you've met two Nadjas, right?

14:10.440 --> 14:12.170
Why didn't you get me?

14:12.470 --> 14:13.730
Me, her mother!

14:14.470 --> 14:16.020
It's because you <i>are</i> her mother.

14:16.710 --> 14:18.390
You think with your emotions.

14:19.380 --> 14:23.060
The one who is suitable to become the successor to the Preminger House...

14:23.480 --> 14:26.980
Can only be ascertained by someone calm like me.

14:27.480 --> 14:29.480
Suitable or not, successor or not...

14:29.750 --> 14:33.180
That's all you talk about, but it isn't good for anything!

14:33.720 --> 14:35.600
Colette, watch your mouth.

14:36.170 --> 14:39.400
I don't care about the Preminger House.

14:39.500 --> 14:42.410
Compared to how important my daughter is, it has no worth.

14:44.060 --> 14:47.550
London

14:51.080 --> 14:52.360
Mrs. Edna!

14:53.820 --> 14:55.700
Christian! Welcome home.

14:55.770 --> 14:56.490
I'm home.

14:56.910 --> 14:58.530
Thank you for taking care of my home.

14:58.830 --> 15:00.190
Extra, extra!

15:00.440 --> 15:03.320
The Black Rose has been arrested in Vienna!

15:07.250 --> 15:09.220
Oh! Isn't that Nadja?

15:09.720 --> 15:12.330
Why is Nadja...with the Black Rose...

15:12.710 --> 15:14.480
Eh? Nadja is the fake one?

15:15.030 --> 15:16.060
Nadja?

15:16.830 --> 15:18.680
To think Nadja got arrested...

15:23.050 --> 15:26.750
Hold on, Nadja! We'll definitely rescue you!

15:27.020 --> 15:28.750
What about rescuing?

15:28.970 --> 15:32.550
Earlier, you were wrong to let Nadja go alone.

15:32.630 --> 15:35.490
That's right! If it were us, we wouldn't have let her go!

15:35.840 --> 15:38.030
We didn't want to let her go!

15:38.600 --> 15:42.450
Well, it seems your feeling for Nadja only amounts to that level.

15:42.850 --> 15:46.060
I skipped out of work for Nadja and came here.

15:46.230 --> 15:48.920
I skipped work for Nadja too!

15:49.090 --> 15:50.970
For Nadja's sake, I also...

15:51.590 --> 15:52.970
For Nadja's sake, I...

15:53.810 --> 15:55.540
I won't eat sweets for a while for Nadja's sake!

15:55.690 --> 15:56.870
How pitiful.

15:58.060 --> 16:00.330
Nadja has someone she likes.

16:00.750 --> 16:01.610
Me?

16:02.280 --> 16:03.290
Not at all.

16:04.850 --> 16:06.750
Nadja is in danger!

16:07.260 --> 16:09.710
George, hurry up!

16:10.050 --> 16:11.440
Right, I understand.

16:18.990 --> 16:21.090
Too bad for you, Nadja.

16:21.630 --> 16:22.970
Rosso! Bianco!

16:23.430 --> 16:25.510
Even if you scream, it won't help you.

16:25.900 --> 16:27.680
Absolutely no one will hear you outside.

16:27.800 --> 16:29.380
Accept your official position.

16:38.250 --> 16:39.210
Master Herman?

16:39.310 --> 16:40.300
What are you doing?

16:40.790 --> 16:42.170
Rosso, Bianco...

16:42.350 --> 16:44.440
Your new job.

16:44.940 --> 16:47.310
Watch after Nadja over there.

16:47.700 --> 16:48.570
Together.

16:49.880 --> 16:51.800
You're a bad person!

16:51.830 --> 16:52.660
Damn you!

16:53.630 --> 16:54.520
You snake!

16:54.590 --> 16:55.230
Shut up!

16:56.240 --> 16:58.390
Everyone is making a fool of me.

16:58.810 --> 17:01.730
I will teach a lesson to everyone who opposes me!

17:03.450 --> 17:05.820
Whatever you do, I won't give up!

17:07.480 --> 17:10.220
Someone who deceives and hurts others...

17:10.640 --> 17:11.600
I won't lose to you.

17:11.820 --> 17:12.610
Absolutely not!

17:18.390 --> 17:20.190
Keep screaming, brat.

17:34.780 --> 17:37.180
W-what is that rabble?

17:37.520 --> 17:40.110
There are only poor commoners gathered.

17:40.340 --> 17:41.690
They're waiting for the Black Rose.

17:42.090 --> 17:44.680
But I employed many bodyguards.

17:44.980 --> 17:46.530
It doesn't matter where he enters.

17:54.240 --> 17:55.540
I-it can't be!

17:55.640 --> 17:57.150
From the main entrance!

18:01.740 --> 18:03.490
Hey, what are you doing?

18:03.590 --> 18:05.840
This iron door is pretty old.

18:06.180 --> 18:08.630
If I do this, it might break apart.

18:10.010 --> 18:11.390
Hey, hurry and help me.

18:11.760 --> 18:12.310
Right!

18:12.900 --> 18:15.050
Stupid, why are you obeying her?

18:15.570 --> 18:17.320
But I was asked...

18:17.660 --> 18:19.320
I...idiot...

18:42.350 --> 18:43.960
Assemble at the western plaza!

18:44.150 --> 18:46.520
West! He said the western plaza!

18:48.870 --> 18:49.980
It's terrible...!

18:51.160 --> 18:54.000
Word is that the Black Rose has appeared...

18:54.180 --> 18:54.970
What!?

18:59.290 --> 18:59.850
Keith...

19:03.210 --> 19:04.000
Western plaza.

19:06.940 --> 19:08.030
Western plaza!

19:09.330 --> 19:10.840
Go to the western plaza!

19:20.250 --> 19:21.460
This is amazing.

19:21.850 --> 19:23.970
Is the whole town assembled?

19:24.100 --> 19:24.540
Yeah.

19:25.630 --> 19:26.300
He's there!

19:31.130 --> 19:31.780
I...

19:33.580 --> 19:37.950
I wanted to make this world a world where everyone could be free.

19:38.520 --> 19:39.800
Free from social status...

19:40.270 --> 19:43.820
Where everyone can choose their own way of living by their own will.

19:44.740 --> 19:47.820
Believing that, I continued to steal.

19:48.370 --> 19:49.820
That was my belief.

19:50.410 --> 19:54.540
But because of me, an innocent person has been arrested.

19:55.150 --> 19:58.440
No one should have to suffer because of my beliefs.

19:59.150 --> 20:03.970
Therefore...the Black Rose will vanish into the night for the last time.

20:06.390 --> 20:07.770
I want to say one more thing.

20:09.250 --> 20:11.370
I have met a certain girl.

20:12.360 --> 20:15.420
She has endured a lot of hardship and suffering.

20:15.940 --> 20:17.740
However, she never gives up.

20:18.390 --> 20:21.250
Even if she has to suffer today, she is trying her best for tomorrow.

20:21.990 --> 20:23.740
Surely, even now.

20:24.780 --> 20:28.290
The era of social status being decided by birth has ended.

20:29.050 --> 20:31.570
Now the ones trying hard will be rewarded.

